(7198521, 1107431, 114285, '<td valign="top">I like ferns I really do. These seem a little soft to me, I would of sharpened them a little or made them stand out somehow more. I use detail extractor in CEP and they give them that HDR look without the image being HDR. <br/> <br/>I like the winding road also, nice leading lines, but you might get pinged because it''s a landscape challenge, and this strikes me as something different. This would of done well in the ''out of the car'' challenge though :)</td>', 'I like ferns I really do. These seem a little soft to me, I would of sharpened them a little or made them stand out somehow more. I use detail extractor in CEP and they give them that HDR look without the image being HDR.  I like the winding road also, nice leading lines, but you might get pinged because it''s a landscape challenge, and this strikes me as something different. This would of done well in the ''out of the car'' challenge though :)', '2014-04-04 03:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
