(7198670, 1107235, 19825, '<td valign="top">Much to love about this one. I really like the detail of the splayed feathers in the wing contrasted by the fading detail of the landscape. The nice progression of dark to light. Admirably handled.</td>', 'Much to love about this one. I really like the detail of the splayed feathers in the wing contrasted by the fading detail of the landscape. The nice progression of dark to light. Admirably handled.', '2014-04-04 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
