(7198960, 1107363, 94815, '<td valign="top">Moodily solitary in a normally busy place.</td>', 'Moodily solitary in a normally busy place.', '2014-04-04 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198961, 1107527, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautifully framed. 7</td>', 'Beautifully framed. 7', '2014-04-04 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198963, 1107260, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the topic and well executed.</td>', 'Nice take on the topic and well executed.', '2014-04-04 22:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198989, 1107449, 173844, '<td valign="top">These oh so strange sheep seem to be an alien colony hidden in a notch in a rugged Shangri-La.  I appreciate the wild depth of this landscape.  I also like how the foggy blur of the background bears a semblance to the sky.</td>', 'These oh so strange sheep seem to be an alien colony hidden in a notch in a rugged Shangri-La.  I appreciate the wild depth of this landscape.  I also like how the foggy blur of the background bears a semblance to the sky.', '2014-04-05 00:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198991, 1107273, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s something harmonious and peaceful about this seemingly busy landscape.  I think it has to do with the distribution of colors and the delicately balanced composition.  It''s a fine earthy evocation of the arid west.</td>', 'There''s something harmonious and peaceful about this seemingly busy landscape.  I think it has to do with the distribution of colors and the delicately balanced composition.  It''s a fine earthy evocation of the arid west.', '2014-04-05 00:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198993, 1107513, 173844, '<td valign="top">A focused study of a locale that in another image in the challenge was a much more expansive landscape.  Here we can pay attention to the pleasing contrast between the blues and the honey browns.  The rocks stabilize the bank so that it doesn''t up and ramble off, like the animal it so resembles.  Very nice.</td>', 'A focused study of a locale that in another image in the challenge was a much more expansive landscape.  Here we can pay attention to the pleasing contrast between the blues and the honey browns.  The rocks stabilize the bank so that it doesn''t up and ramble off, like the animal it so resembles.  Very nice.', '2014-04-05 00:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198994, 1107531, 173844, '<td valign="top">A pleasing, orderly, bucolic landscape that offers its viewers a comfortable interlude in the country.  The composition and lines are impeccable.  Very satisfying.</td>', 'A pleasing, orderly, bucolic landscape that offers its viewers a comfortable interlude in the country.  The composition and lines are impeccable.  Very satisfying.', '2014-04-05 00:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198997, 1107439, 173844, '<td valign="top">The foremost focus on the delicate flowers is like an offering of candy.  The soft background functions as a plush platter.  All in all this is very pretty.</td>', 'The foremost focus on the delicate flowers is like an offering of candy.  The soft background functions as a plush platter.  All in all this is very pretty.', '2014-04-05 00:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198998, 1107410, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple and touching, as I believe it''s meant to be.  The snow is crisp and pure, the birches glow with life and the darker trees are history.</td>', 'Simple and touching, as I believe it''s meant to be.  The snow is crisp and pure, the birches glow with life and the darker trees are history.', '2014-04-05 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7198999, 1107523, 173844, '<td valign="top">A nice immediacy which really conveys the brisk conditions.</td>', 'A nice immediacy which really conveys the brisk conditions.', '2014-04-05 00:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199000, 1107421, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this really strong foreground.</td>', 'I like this really strong foreground.', '2014-04-05 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199003, 1107527, 173844, '<td valign="top">The stump lends an elegiac tone to this otherwise luxuriant forest, suggesting threats that are afoot.</td>', 'The stump lends an elegiac tone to this otherwise luxuriant forest, suggesting threats that are afoot.', '2014-04-05 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199004, 1107363, 173844, '<td valign="top">An urban landscape.  Is this Bryant Park in Manhattan, behind the 42nd St. Main Library?  Though I could be way off.  It feels doleful, like an absence of nature, but I think that''s just personal subjectivity.  I like the smorgasbord of tones and the contrast between the sodded lawn and the fussily rectilinear bank of buildings in the background.</td>', 'An urban landscape.  Is this Bryant Park in Manhattan, behind the 42nd St. Main Library?  Though I could be way off.  It feels doleful, like an absence of nature, but I think that''s just personal subjectivity.  I like the smorgasbord of tones and the contrast between the sodded lawn and the fussily rectilinear bank of buildings in the background.', '2014-04-05 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199005, 1107264, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting agricultural landscape.</td>', 'Very interesting agricultural landscape.', '2014-04-05 00:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199006, 1107430, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very Cezanne.</td>', 'Very Cezanne.', '2014-04-05 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199007, 1107525, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the way the tree limbs seem to be flying.</td>', 'I like the way the tree limbs seem to be flying.', '2014-04-05 00:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199009, 1107077, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape abstract.</td>', 'Interesting landscape abstract.', '2014-04-05 00:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199015, 1107450, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s a limited landscape, but I''ll go for this contrasty patch of woods.</td>', 'It''s a limited landscape, but I''ll go for this contrasty patch of woods.', '2014-04-05 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199021, 1107443, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think this image is quite effective especially with an unexpected palette, sensitively detailed composition, and well managed deep focus technique. But to my eye those bars ruin it (never to be seen in a gallery so why here?) It''s a 7 quality shot but please rethink using the bars in the future. Why destroy an otherwise beautiful presentation? 5.5 (which way should I round?) Ok 6.</td>', 'I think this image is quite effective especially with an unexpected palette, sensitively detailed composition, and well managed deep focus technique. But to my eye those bars ruin it (never to be seen in a gallery so why here?) It''s a 7 quality shot but please rethink using the bars in the future. Why destroy an otherwise beautiful presentation? 5.5 (which way should I round?) Ok 6.', '2014-04-05 01:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199086, 1107443, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is the most creative image here, top 3 for me.</td>', 'This is the most creative image here, top 3 for me.', '2014-04-05 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
