(7199595, 1107530, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the stonework and a complementary backdrop. I like the mix of horizontal and vertical elements. I would have considered a horizontal flip to create more of a left to right than right to left movement, but that is a relatively minor issue and is often easier for someone who has never visited a place to contemplate!</td>', 'Lovely detail in the stonework and a complementary backdrop. I like the mix of horizontal and vertical elements. I would have considered a horizontal flip to create more of a left to right than right to left movement, but that is a relatively minor issue and is often easier for someone who has never visited a place to contemplate!', '2014-04-06 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
