(7199811, 1107531, 23484, '<td valign="top">The color tone is neat.</td>', 'The color tone is neat.', '2014-04-06 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199815, 1107264, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite and only 10.  I love the interest of this - all those tidy though irregularly shaped blocks, the different tones and textures of the fields and vineyards, the rocky outcropping, the terraced hillside in the distance and the miniature homes and outbuildings.  Nice.</td>', 'My favorite and only 10.  I love the interest of this - all those tidy though irregularly shaped blocks, the different tones and textures of the fields and vineyards, the rocky outcropping, the terraced hillside in the distance and the miniature homes and outbuildings.  Nice.', '2014-04-06 23:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199816, 1107430, 138630, '<td valign="top">An excellent subject with lovely undulating lines.  I like the patches of light interspersed with the shadow.  The shadow area does have a bluish cast that seems a little off to me.  Still one of my top picks.  9  Voted earlier.</td>', 'An excellent subject with lovely undulating lines.  I like the patches of light interspersed with the shadow.  The shadow area does have a bluish cast that seems a little off to me.  Still one of my top picks.  9  Voted earlier.', '2014-04-06 23:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199818, 1107269, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely layers and I especially like the band of low-lying fog across the center and the light in the upper left.  Pretty country.  9 from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lovely layers and I especially like the band of low-lying fog across the center and the light in the upper left.  Pretty country.  9 from me.  Voted earlier.', '2014-04-06 23:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199819, 1107406, 138630, '<td valign="top">The vertical threw me at first - unusual for a landscape but then I thought why not and what other orientation would one use for this scene?  Dramatic and striking and I love the tiny figure for scale.  Bump to 9</td>', 'The vertical threw me at first - unusual for a landscape but then I thought why not and what other orientation would one use for this scene?  Dramatic and striking and I love the tiny figure for scale.  Bump to 9', '2014-04-06 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199820, 1107449, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the depth here and the remote feel of the location.  It''s so much about the sheep which makes it most interesting but less of a landscape in my view.  Still terrific.  8  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I love the depth here and the remote feel of the location.  It''s so much about the sheep which makes it most interesting but less of a landscape in my view.  Still terrific.  8  Voted earlier.', '2014-04-06 23:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199824, 1107283, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is just wonderful.</td>', 'This is just wonderful.', '2014-04-07 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199825, 1107461, 97225, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, nicely composed. I like the mix of geometric and organic features.</td>', 'Interesting view, nicely composed. I like the mix of geometric and organic features.', '2014-04-07 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7199829, 1107406, 152252, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting, hands down. I have a weird feeling like I''ve seen those trees somewhere before... and I still love them. Top 3. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Amazing lighting, hands down. I have a weird feeling like I''ve seen those trees somewhere before... and I still love them. Top 3. (voted earlier)', '2014-04-07 00:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
