(7199840, 1107017, 138630, '<td valign="top">I wish the center trees were not quite so white but I do love the lines and cool tones.  Very calming.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I wish the center trees were not quite so white but I do love the lines and cool tones.  Very calming.  Voted earlier.', '2014-04-07 00:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
